%%{init: {'theme':'dark','themeVariables':{'fontSize':'14px','actorTextColor':'#E0E7FF','actorBkg':'#4338CA','actorBorder':'#6366F1','activationBorderColor':'#6366F1','signalColor':'#CBD5E1','signalTextColor':'#E2E8F0','noteBkgColor':'#1E293B','noteBorderColor':'#6366F1','noteTextColor':'#E2E8F0'},'sequence':{'mirrorActors':false,'messageFontSize':13,'actorFontSize':14,'noteMargin':10,'messageMargin':35,'width':220}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant K   as Apache Kafka
    participant DC  as DeployEventConsumer
    participant IA  as IdempotencyAdapter (DB)
    participant PS  as ProcessDeployResultService

    Note over K,PS: CENÁRIO 1 — Primeiro processamento (happy path)

    K->>DC: DeployFinishedEvent {deployId: "deploy-abc-001"}
    DC->>IA: tryMarkAsProcessed("deploy-abc-001", "deploy-orchestrator")
    IA->>IA: INSERT INTO processed_events (event_id='deploy-abc-001', ...)<br/>ON CONFLICT (event_id) DO NOTHING
    Note over IA: PostgreSQL: nenhum conflito → linha inserida
    IA-->>DC: true (novo evento)
    DC->>PS: execute(ProcessDeployCommand)
    PS-->>DC: ✓ status atualizado, resultado publicado
    DC-->>K: commitOffset

    Note over K,PS: CENÁRIO 2 — Evento duplicado (Kafka re-entrega por retry/rebalance)

    K->>DC: DeployFinishedEvent {deployId: "deploy-abc-001"} (re-entrega)
    DC->>IA: tryMarkAsProcessed("deploy-abc-001", "deploy-orchestrator")
    IA->>IA: INSERT INTO processed_events (event_id='deploy-abc-001', ...)<br/>ON CONFLICT (event_id) DO NOTHING
    Note over IA: PostgreSQL: conflito detectado → 0 linhas afetadas
    IA-->>DC: false (duplicata)
    DC->>DC: events_discarded_total.increment()
    DC->>DC: log.warn("Duplicate event discarded: deployId=deploy-abc-001")
    DC-->>K: commitOffset (sem reprocessamento)

    Note over K,PS: CENÁRIO 3 — Race condition (duas réplicas do serviço processam simultaneamente)

    par Réplica A
        K->>DC: DeployFinishedEvent {deployId: "deploy-xyz-999"}
        DC->>IA: tryMarkAsProcessed("deploy-xyz-999", ...)
        IA->>IA: INSERT ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING
        Note over IA: Réplica A vence a corrida
        IA-->>DC: true → processa normalmente
    and Réplica B
        K->>DC: DeployFinishedEvent {deployId: "deploy-xyz-999"}
        DC->>IA: tryMarkAsProcessed("deploy-xyz-999", ...)
        IA->>IA: INSERT ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING
        Note over IA: Conflito: Réplica A já inseriu
        IA-->>DC: false → descarta silenciosamente
    end

    Note over IA: Atomicidade garantida pelo PostgreSQL.<br/>Exatamente UM processamento em qualquer cenário.

    Note over K,PS: CENÁRIO 4 — Falha após idempotência (evento não reprocessado na re-entrega)

    K->>DC: DeployFinishedEvent {deployId: "deploy-fail-777"}
    DC->>IA: tryMarkAsProcessed("deploy-fail-777", ...)
    IA-->>DC: true (novo evento)
    DC->>PS: execute(ProcessDeployCommand)
    PS->>PS: Exceção durante atualização de status (ex: DB timeout)
    PS-->>DC: throws RuntimeException
    Note over DC: @Transactional rollback:<br/>processed_events registro revertido
    DC->>DC: Retry automático pelo @RetryableTopic
    K->>DC: Re-entrega (retry 1)
    DC->>IA: tryMarkAsProcessed("deploy-fail-777", ...)
    Note over IA: Rollback reverteu o INSERT → linha não existe
    IA-->>DC: true (processa novamente — correto!)
